Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:11:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: IOleUndoManager with undo and redo stacks;
 IPersistFile Load/GetCurFile/SaveCompleted

The undo manager that the document hands out through IServiceProvider kept nothing. It now holds the undo and redo stacks, forwards units to the innermost open parent unit, runs UndoTo/RedoTo (units add their inverse back to the manager), clears the redo history on a new action, enumerates most recent first, reports descriptions and honours Enable.

IPersistFile::Load loads the file through its file: URL; GetCurFile returns the local path of a file: document.

